# Muze Next Steps

Completed discussion-owner join notification behavior is documented in `docs/discussions.md`.

## Live verification and rollout

☐ Test with an owner and at least two joiners in Persian and English:
- owner viewing the same room receives only the live room notice;
- owner with no active room receives the private notification and opens the room in one tap;
- owner active in another room sees only the leave-current-first warning;
- repeated leave/rejoin by one account is counted once per notification window;
- rapid distinct joins produce one immediate card and one accurate summary;
- stale Open actions for closed or unavailable rooms fail safely;
- rollout switch off suppresses only private owner join cards.

☐ Verify the `due_owner_join_notice_summaries` index exists before production rollout.

☐ Deploy only after explicit approval, following `docs/fresh-server-deployment.md` one section at a time. Never run tests, seed scripts, clearing scripts, or load tests against the production database.

☐ After rollout, monitor private-card delivery failures, summary volume, suppression rates, and Open usage. Do not bulk rewrite user or discussion documents.
